{"meta":{"ui":"expenses","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"retry","prompt":"I have four expenses waiting for my approval from one report. Show them in a card with merchant, category, date and amount, flag the one missing a receipt, let me approve or reject each, and show the approved total and a submit button.","text":"ChatCard \"Expense report\" \"Four expenses awaiting approval\" icon:\"receipt_long\" status:\"Pending\" tone:\"accent\"\n  state expenses=[{\"id\":1,\"merchant\":\"Delta Airlines\",\"category\":\"Travel\",\"date\":\"Mar 3\",\"amount\":412.80,\"receipt\":true,\"ok\":true},{\"id\":2,\"merchant\":\"Marriott Hotel\",\"category\":\"Lodging\",\"date\":\"Mar 4\",\"amount\":268.50,\"receipt\":true,\"ok\":true},{\"id\":3,\"merchant\":\"Uber\",\"category\":\"Ground transport\",\"date\":\"Mar 4\",\"amount\":46.20,\"receipt\":false,\"ok\":true},{\"id\":4,\"merchant\":\"Client dinner\",\"category\":\"Meals\",\"date\":\"Mar 5\",\"amount\":128.40,\"receipt\":true,\"ok\":true}]\n  each e in expenses\n    Row between\n      Column gap:2\n        Text.strong \"{e.merchant}\"\n        Text.muted \"{e.category} · {e.date}\"\n        if e.receipt==false\n          Callout \"Missing receipt\" \"Attach a receipt before approving.\" tone:\"warn\" icon:\"warning_amber_rounded\"\n      Column gap:6 right\n        Text.strong \"{money(e.amount,\"$\",2)}\"\n        Row gap:6\n          ChoiceChip \"Approve\" selected:=e.ok==true -> expenses=updateWhere(expenses,x=>x.id==e.id,x=>with(x,\"ok\",true))\n          ChoiceChip \"Reject\" selected:=e.ok==false -> expenses=updateWhere(expenses,x=>x.id==e.id,x=>with(x,\"ok\",false))\n  Details rows:=[[\"Approved total\",money(sum(filter(expenses,x=>x.ok==true),x=>x.amount),\"$\",2)],[\"Pending items\",string(count(expenses,x=>x.ok==null))]]\n  ActionButton label:\"Submit report\" tone:\"primary\" icon:\"send_rounded\" enabled:=count(expenses,x=>x.ok==null)==0 -> emit submit","usage":{"input_token